-- תקנות הביטוח הלאומי (תשלום ופטור מתשלום דמי ביטוח), התשנ"ה-1995 —
-- regulations 1, 4 and 5. The text is
-- laws/national-insurance-payment-regulations.toml, pinned from the live
-- page of ספר החוקים הפתוח; the corpus holds no copy. Every section here
-- is SOURCE ONLY (MMS-781): its block holds a note and no rule.

IMPORT prelude

§ `תקנות הביטוח הלאומי (תשלום ופטור מתשלום דמי ביטוח) — שכר, הפרשים ותשלום נוסף`

§§ `1`

-- law:1 SOURCE ONLY, NOT ENCODED (MMS-781): the definitions — "שכר",
-- "שכר חודשי רגיל" and "תשלום נוסף", pay given beside the regular monthly
-- salary, bonuses included and arrears excluded.

§§ `4`

-- law:4 SOURCE ONLY, NOT ENCODED (MMS-781): arrears count as the regular
-- monthly salary of the months they were paid for.

§§ `5`

-- law:5 SOURCE ONLY, NOT ENCODED (MMS-781): an additional payment of 25%
-- of the minimum wage or more is divided by twelve and added to the month
-- it is paid in and each of the eleven before it (fewer for a shorter
-- employment); a smaller one is added to the month it is paid in. Whether a
-- teacher's clothing allowance is such a payment is not decided here.
